   ChromeOptions options = new ChromeOptions();
    --> Headless
    ---> Incognite
    ---> Badssl

   WebDriver driver = new ChromeDriver(options);

ChromeOptions
-1) Launch Headless -->  options.addArguments("--headless=new")
-2) BadSSl ->  options.setAcceptInsecureCerts(true);
-3) incognito --> options.addArguments("--incognito");
-4) To remove Chrome Runnning Notification -> options.setExperimentalOption("excludeSwitches" ,new String[]{"enable-automation"});